# Text → notation: a program's text read as Node, data and code alike (notes/wap.md "The pipeline").
#
# Milestone 1 reuses warp's reader, `parse`, as notes/backbone.md decides. Before milestone 2 this file becomes the
# pure notation reader: atoms, keys, lists and phrases, with no keyword branches, the operators from
# core/reading/operators.wap.

notation(source: text) as Node := parse(source)
